# Week 1 – Project Initialization and Problem Understanding

## Project Title
Agri Yield Prediction Using Machine Learning

## Problem Statement
Agriculture is the backbone of the Indian economy. Accurate crop yield prediction helps farmers and government bodies in planning cultivation strategies, managing resources, and ensuring food security. Traditional yield estimation methods are often inaccurate due to changing climatic conditions and soil variability. Hence, an intelligent system is required to predict crop yield efficiently.

## Objective
- To understand the agricultural yield prediction problem
- To identify important factors affecting crop yield
- To propose a machine learning–based solution
- To plan the project architecture and workflow

## Proposed Solution
The proposed system uses machine learning algorithms trained on historical agricultural data such as crop type, area, season, and production. A web-based application will allow users to input relevant details and obtain predicted crop yield.

## Tools and Technologies
- Programming Language: Python
- Machine Learning Libraries: Scikit-learn, XGBoost
- Web Framework: Flask
- Frontend: HTML, CSS
- Deployment Platform: Render / Heroku

## Project Workflow
1. Problem understanding and requirement analysis
2. Dataset collection and preprocessing
3. Model training and evaluation
4. Web application development
5. Deployment and testing

## Outcome of Week 1
- Clear understanding of the problem domain
- Defined project objectives
- Finalized tools and technologies
- Planned workflow for upcoming weeks

